  "daily_overview": "今日全球局势多点联动：科技领域，PHP 安全漏洞引发全球代码审计热潮，AI Agent 开始深度介入企业自动化，从代码清理到量化交易研究，AI 计算能力正演变为类似石油的新兴交易资产。金融市场方面，巴克莱银行因 AI 替代效应裁员 5000 人，全球资本市场面临科技股震荡与中东局势升级的避险需求。时政层面，国际刑事法院获萨哈罗夫奖引关注，美欧多地因国内政治动荡与选举博弈面临舆论与法规压力。各领域信号表明，生产力升级正伴随着剧烈的岗位重组与地缘博弈。\n\nToday's global landscape shows strong interconnections: In tech, PHP vulnerabilities have sparked a wave of security audits, while AI agents are deeply integrating into enterprise workflows, from technical debt cleanup to quantitative research. AI compute is emerging as a new commodity, similar to oil. Financially, Barclays cut 5,000 jobs due to AI, as markets react to tech sector volatility and Middle East tensions. Politically, the ICC winning the Sakharov Prize has drawn attention, alongside internal political turbulence in the US and EU. These signals highlight that productivity growth is currently accompanied by intense job restructuring and geopolitical maneuvering.",
